<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameData>
	<LocalizedText>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Ichijou Corporation</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Ichijou Corporation</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_ADJECTIVE" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Ichijou</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Ichijou Ririka</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Good Work on Your Oshi Activities~</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>[Working Title] This leader's unique ability (Monopolies and Corporations mode OFF) has not been designed yet.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_MONOPOLIES_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Great Genius</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_MONOPOLIES_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Industries provide an additional +2 [ICON_Culture] Culture, +2 [ICON_Science] Science, and +1 [ICON_Gold] Gold. Corporations provide twice the Culture and Science. Corporation product projects gain +100% [ICON_Production] Production.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>KPG</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Likes civilizations that are not warmongers. Has disdain for warmongering civilizations.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_LEADER_ANY_REASON_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA" Language="en_US">
			<Text>No wars, no worries! I'd love for us to keep getting along like this.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_LEADER_ANY_REASON_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Must you keep fighting? Let's find something more fun to do instead...</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_LIKES_PEACE" Language="en_US">
			<Text>They are pleased to see a civilization that is not a warmonger</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_DISLIKES_WAR" Language="en_US">
			<Text>They are unhappy with your warmongering</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_GREETING_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Oh, hey! What's up, need something from Ririka?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Whoa, nice to meet you! I'm Ichijou Ririka, CEO of Ichijou Corporation. Let's get along, okay~</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_VISIT_RECIPIENT_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, hey, we've got an office nearby—wanna stop by? It's just an office, but I can still treat you to something!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NEAR_INITIATOR_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Of course I'll come! Honestly, I've been curious about your country~</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_FIRST_MEET_NO_MANS_INFO_EXCHANGE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Guess we're both pretty far from each other~ Wanna trade maps?</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>...Sorry. I really didn't want it to come to this. But I can't just sit back and watch anymore. We have to fight.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_WAR_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Huh!? Wait, are you serious!? ...Fine, I'm done. Don't come crying to me over this.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>...No way. Is this... really it...</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DEFEAT_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>...No way. Is this... really it...</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, let's take a pic together and post it online! Let's show the whole world we're friends now!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yay! Hehe, let's get along from now on. And be good to my company too, okay?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Wait, seriously...? W-well, fine, I guess...</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Of course! Wanting to be friends with Ririka? Now that's good taste.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DECLARE_FRIEND_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hmm, I don't think the timing's right just yet. Sorry about that.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, aren't we basically in this together already?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yay! Now we can't ever let go of each other.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Oh... really? A little sad, but I guess that's how it goes.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Of course! I feel like we could really make this work together.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_ALLIANCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hmm, I don't think we're quite there yet. Sorry.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>I'm done putting up with this. I'm telling everyone, so you'd better be ready.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DENOUNCE_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Huh? Where's that even coming from... You're the one who should be reflecting.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_EXIT_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Your country always seems so calm and peaceful. Honestly, it puts my mind at ease just watching.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_EXIT_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, isn't it feeling a little tense over there lately...? You could probably stand to loosen up a bit.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, mind if I send some of my staff over? I'll make sure they say a proper hello.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yes! Thanks. I'll make sure they behave themselves.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Huh, no good...? Well, I guess that's fair.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Of course, come by anytime!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_DELEGATION_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sorry, things are a little hectic right now... maybe next time.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_EMBASSY_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, mind if I station one of my people over there? I'll make sure they do a good job.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_EMBASSY_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yes! I'll make sure my rep works hard out there.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_EMBASSY_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Oh, I see... Well, no demand, no need for it, I suppose.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_EMBASSY_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Of course, go ahead and station someone here!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_EMBASSY_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hmm, sorry, that's a bit of a no for now.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, wanna let each other move around freely?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yay! Now I can drop by anytime I want.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Ahh, I see. Guess it's still a bit early. Sorry.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sure, feel free to come on over!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_OPEN_BORDERS_FROM_HUMAN_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sorry, not quite yet...</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_DEAL_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Okay, these terms work for me!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_DEAL_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hmm, I don't think I can go along with this.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_DEAL_AI_ADJUST_DEAL_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hmm, I'd like to tweak the terms a little. How about this?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yay, deal closed! Thanks a bunch.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_DEAL_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Aw, no good, huh? I'll try again some other time.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, can we just end this already? I'm so tired of fighting...</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_ACCEPT_DEAL_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>...Okay. That works. Let's just end this.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MAKE_PEACE_AI_REFUSE_DEAL_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Huh? Don't mess with me, there's no way I'm accepting those terms.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_ACCEPT_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Thank goodness... I mean it. Thank you.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_REJECT_MAKE_PEACE_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>What? You still want to keep going...? Fine, I'm done.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_AI_ACCEPT_DEMAND_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>...Fine. Just this once, okay?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_AI_REFUSE_DEMAND_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Uh, no way! That's a total loss for me.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_HUMAN_ACCEPT_DEMAND_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yes, you actually get it! Thanks.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_HUMAN_REFUSE_DEMAND_FROM_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Aw, stingy. Well, I'll remember this.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, don't open a branch that close, okay? Go find somewhere a little further away.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_HUMAN_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Thanks, glad you get it.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_HUMAN_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>If you're going to ignore my territory, then I won't be looking out for you either.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Oh, sorry, sorry! I didn't realize it was that close.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_DONT_SETTLE_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>I need more locations too, you know. Since when do you get a say in that?</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_CONVERTING_MY_CITIES_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, could you not proselytize at my company?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_CONVERTING_MY_CITIES_HUMAN_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Thanks.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_CONVERTING_MY_CITIES_HUMAN_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Ugh... if that's how it's gonna be, I might just start proselytizing too, you know?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_CONVERTING_MY_CITIES_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Well, fine, I'll hear you out... but I still think I'm the one who's right.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_CONVERTING_MY_CITIES_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Nope, this is for the best. You'll get it eventually.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_DIGGING_UP_ARTIFACTS_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, don't go digging around on my land without asking.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_DIGGING_UP_ARTIFACTS_HUMAN_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Thanks.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_DIGGING_UP_ARTIFACTS_HUMAN_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>If you won't respect me, then I can't respect you either.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_DIGGING_UP_ARTIFACTS_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Oh, I didn't realize that was your land. Sorry about that.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_DIGGING_UP_ARTIFACTS_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>It's old stuff, though—does it really matter who picks it up?</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_SPYING_ON_ME_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, could you stop sending spies my way?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_SPYING_ON_ME_HUMAN_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Thanks.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_SPYING_ON_ME_HUMAN_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hmm... that's a problem. Guess I'll have to fight back too.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_SPYING_ON_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Yeah, you're right... sorry for pulling that. Won't happen again.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_STOP_SPYING_ON_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Ha! What makes you think I'd actually promise that?</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hey, isn't that a lot of troops crowding my property? Hope you're just here for the view.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_HUMAN_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Thanks.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_POSITIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Oops, sorry—was just looking for a good spot to clear out some barbarians.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_TOO_MANY_TROOPS_NEAR_ME_AI_RESPONSE_NEGATIVE_LEADER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_ANY" Language="en_US">
			<Text>I'm not even in your territory, so what I do is none of your business, right?</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>The Junior Secretaries' Hustle</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Tiles with an improved resource provide +3 [ICON_Gold] Gold for a Bonus resource, +5 for a Strategic resource, and +10 for a Luxury resource.</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_HQ" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Tokyo Headquarters</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_01" Language="en_US">
			<Text>New York Branch Office</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_02" Language="en_US">
			<Text>London Branch Office</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_03" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Paris Branch Office</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_04" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Shanghai Branch Office</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_05" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Hong Kong Branch Office</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CITY_NAME_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_06" Language="en_US">
